BIDWELL'S TRAVELS.\par
\par
FROM\par
\par
Wall Street\par
\par
To London Prison\par
\par
\par
_Fifteen Years in Solitude._\par
\par
\par
  FREED A HUMAN WRECK, A WONDERFUL SURVIVAL AND A MORE\par
    WONDERFUL RISE IN THE WORLD.\par
  TO-DAY HE HAS A NATIONAL REPUTATION AS A WRITER, SPEAKER\par
    AND IS CONSIDERED AN AUTHORITY ON ALL SOCIAL PROBLEMS.\par
  HE WAS TRIED AT THE OLD BAILEY AND SENTENCED FOR LIFE.\par
    CHARGED WITH THE L1,000,000 FORGERY ON THE BANK\par
      OF ENGLAND.\par
\par
  THIS STORY SHOWS THAT THE EVENTS OF HIS LIFE SURPASS THE\par
    IMAGINATIONS OF OUR FAMOUS NOVELISTS, ITS THRILLING\par
      SCENES, HAIR-BREADTH ESCAPES AND MARVELOUS ADVENTURES\par
        ARE NOT A RECORD OF CRIME,\par
          BUT ARE PROOFS OF THAT\par
\par
_IN THE WORLD OF WRONGDOING SUCCESS IS FAILURE._\par
\par
